      "items": [
        {
          "text": "10",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now those that sealed",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "were",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NEH.10.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NEH.10.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", Nehemiah, the Tirshatha, the son of Hachaliah, and Zidkijah,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Seraiah, Azariah, Jeremiah,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pashur, Amariah, Malchijah,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hattush, Shebaniah, Malluch,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Harim, Meremoth, Obadiah,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daniel, Ginnethon, Baruch,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meshullam, Abijah, Mijamin,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maaziah, Bilgai, Shemaiah: these",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "were",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NEH.10.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NEH.10.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the priests.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the Levites: both Jeshua the son of Azaniah, Binnui of the sons of Henadad, Kadmiel;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And their brethren, Shebaniah, Hodijah, Kelita, Pelaiah, Hanan,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Micha, Rehob, Hashabiah,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zaccur, Sherebiah, Shebaniah,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hodijah, Bani, Beninu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The chief of the people; Parosh, Pahath-moab, Elam, Zatthu, Bani,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bunni, Azgad, Bebai,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adonijah, Bigvai, Adin,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ater, Hizkijah, Azzur,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hodijah, Hashum, Bezai,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hariph, Anathoth, Nebai,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Magpiash, Meshullam, Hezir,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meshezabeel, Zadok, Jaddua,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pelatiah, Hanan, Anaiah,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hoshea, Hananiah, Hashub,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hallohesh, Pileha, Shobek,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rehum, Hashabnah, Maaseiah,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Ahijah, Hanan, Anan,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Malluch, Harim, Baanah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ And the rest of the people, the priests, the Levites, the porters, the singers, the Nethinims, and all they that had separated themselves from the people of the lands unto the law of God, their wives, their sons, and their daughters, every one having knowledge, and having understanding;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They clave to their brethren, their nobles, and entered into a curse, and into an oath, to walk in God's law, which was given by Moses the servant of God, and to observe and do all the commandments of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NEH.10.29",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NEH.10.30"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "our Lord, and his judgments and his statutes;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And that we would not give our daughters unto the people of the land, nor take their daughters for our sons:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "if",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NEH.10.31",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NEH.10.32"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the people of the land bring ware or any victuals on the sabbath day to sell,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NEH.10.31",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NEH.10.32"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "we would not buy it of them on the sabbath, or on the holy day: and",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NEH.10.31",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NEH.10.32"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "we would leave the seventh year, and the exaction of every debt.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Also we made ordinances for us, to charge ourselves yearly with the third part of a shekel for the service of the house of our God;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
